OL,3,GNEWSAWider tax reforms delayed until
OL,4,A2028 by parliament
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor tax reforms will not take place
OL,7,Funtil 2028, a Channel Island's
OL,8,Fparliament has confirmed.
OL,10,FSark's Chief Pleas said an increase in
OL,11,Fits operating costs - rising from just
OL,12,Funder #1.6m in 2020 to just about #2.5m
OL,13,Fin 2026 - combined with major
OL,14,Finfrastructure projects, such as
OL,15,Frepairs to La Coupee, underlined the
OL,16,F"need for a fair, sustainable and
OL,17,Fmodernised tax system".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
