OL,3,GNEWSAWider tax reforms delayed until
OL,4,A2028 by parliament
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, it said, following concerns
OL,7,Fraised by islanders which included
OL,8,Faffordability, privacy and the wider
OL,9,Fimpact of reforms, only "limited,
OL,10,Ftargeted changes" would be introduced
OL,11,Ffor the 2027 tax year.
OL,13,FChief Pleas added a package of reforms
OL,14,Fwould be developed for 2028 after
OL,15,Ffurther consultation with Sark's
OL,16,Fresidents.
